{"id":"b185b18d3dbf7e61","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds.md","title":"c.e. 集熵的 Solovay 界与有限集改进","display":"thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds — c.e. 集熵的 Solovay 界与有限集改进","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds","aliases":["43-thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds"],"display":"thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds — c.e. 集熵的 Solovay 界与有限集改进","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce-set-entropy]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 19.2.3 and Theorem 19.2.5","source_printed_pages":"572–573","source_pdf_pages":"592–593","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds — c.e. 集熵的 Solovay 界与有限集改进"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd664f5e3b6d342a\" href=\"?note=fd664f5e3b6d342a\" title=\"43-df-ce-set-entropy\">43-df-ce-set-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 19.2.3 and Theorem 19.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"572–573"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"592–593"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd664f5e3b6d342a\" href=\"?note=fd664f5e3b6d342a\" title=\"43-df-ce-set-entropy\">43-df-ce-set-entropy</a> 中的通用枚举索引，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_e,I\">\\(H_e,I\\)</span> 采用该原子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。所有量化的 A 均为自然数集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_e(A)\">\\(H_e(A)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e(A)&gt;0\">\\(P_e(A)&gt;0\\)</span> 时使用。常数可依赖于固定 e 与复杂度机器，但不依赖 A。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\in\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land P_e(B)&gt;0\\}\\;I(A)\\le3H_e(A)+K(H_e(A))+c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\in\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land P_e(B)&gt;0\\}\\;I(A)\\le3H_e(A)+K(H_e(A))+c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\in\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:|B|&lt;\\infty\\land P_e(B)&gt;0\\}\\;I(A)\\le2H_e(A)+K(H_e(A))+c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\in\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:|B|&lt;\\infty\\land P_e(B)&gt;0\\}\\;I(A)\\le2H_e(A)+K(H_e(A))+c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一般界对应 Solovay 定理，原稿只说由 Lemma 19.2.4 推出而未给该引理证明；有限集二倍界对应 Shen 定理，原稿参考文献为 [?] 且没有证明。本轮确认原书陈述并如实保留证明缺口，不把二倍界推广到任意 c.e. 集。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 19.2.3 and Theorem 19.2.5，印刷页 572–573，PDF 页 592–593。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce-set-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"fd664f5e3b6d342a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-set-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce-set-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"fd664f5e3b6d342a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 为 [[43-df-ce-set-entropy]] 中的通用枚举索引，$H_e,I$ 采用该原子；$\\operatorname{CE}$、$K$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。所有量化的 A 均为自然数集合；$H_e(A)$ 仅在 $P_e(A)>0$ 时使用。常数可依赖于固定 e 与复杂度机器，但不依赖 A。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 为 [[43-df-ce-set-entropy]] 中的通用枚举索引，$H_e,I$ 采用该原子；$\\operatorname{CE}$、$K$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。所有量化的 A 均为自然数集合；$H_e(A)$ 仅在 $P_e(A)>0$ 时使用。常数可依赖于固定 e 与复杂度机器，但不依赖 A。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 为 [[43-df-ce-set-entropy]] 中的通用枚举索引，$H_e,I$ 采用该原子；$\\operatorname{CE}$、$K$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。所有量化的 A 均为自然数集合；$H_e(A)$ 仅在 $P_e(A)>0$ 时使用。常数可依赖于固定 e 与复杂度机器，但不依赖 A。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"H_e,I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"H_e(A)","display":false},{"tex":"P_e(A)>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\in\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land P_e(B)>0\\}\\;I(A)\\le3H_e(A)+K(H_e(A))+c.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\in\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:|B|<\\infty\\land P_e(B)>0\\}\\;I(A)\\le2H_e(A)+K(H_e(A))+c.","display":true}],"bytes":1885,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-483","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ce-set-entropy-bounds]] — c.e. 集熵的 Solovay 界与有限集改进"}],"outgoing":["fd664f5e3b6d342a","6c0559518cd32104","6cd902d852c2c848"]}